      "cost": "0 gp",
      "count": 1,
      "depth": 0,
      "description": "<p>A ledger in a careful clerk's hand, ruled in five columns: <i>Received, Sent West, Spoiled, The Bishop </i>and <i>Shrinkage. </i>Every column adds up. <i>Spoiled </i>and <i>Sent West </i>rise together, week on week, by the same amounts. An entry in Lamashan reads: <i>Helmsmith's, potions, four, bought, two hundred gold. </i>The newest entry, in fresh ink, reads: <i>Arrivals, unscheduled: four.</i></p>",
      "extraplanarcontents": 0,
      "internal_depth": 0,
      "internal_length": 0,
