      "cost": "0 gp",
      "count": 1,
      "depth": 0,
      "description": "<p>A narrow book in a careful clerk's hand: fourteen entries since Rova. For each one, a date, the name the arrival was given, the trade that went with it, and a remark. The remarks are short and not kind: <i>a cooper; cannot cooper. A laundress; for the market end. A widow, for the west end; comes and goes by the ladder. </i>The eighth and the eleventh entries read only <i>For the Preservers, </i>with no remark at all.</p>",
